  "{0}<p>Esta es la siguiente placa. Comprueba que la base está colocada y vacía.</p><label class=\"operator-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" required><span>Nadie está tocando la impresora y sigue preparada con el material indicado.</span></label>": "{0}<p>This is the next plate. Check that the build plate is installed and empty.</p><label class=\"operator-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" required><span>Nobody is touching the printer and it is still prepared with the indicated material.</span></label>",
